<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank 2-week rev repo ave yield 16.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank 2-week rev repo ave yield 16.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield at the Czech central bank's (CNB) two-week reverse repo tender to drain market liquidity on Thursday hit 16.2 percent, unchanged from a similar tender on Wednesday, the CNB said.</p>
<p>It added that all bids at the average yield, which was also the maximum rate, were satisfied. The CNB does not reveal the amount of funds it drains in its open market operations.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
